{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/hunter-the-vigil/25569-how-would-you-do-the-orpheus-group","id":25569,"title":"How would you do the Orpheus Group?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Hunter: The Vigil"],"posts":[{"date":"2013-12-07T20:56:06-08:00","id":25569,"title":"How would you do the Orpheus Group?","content":"I'd been hoping we'd see some sort of projector group in Mortal Remains, but we're only getting Mummy and Demon groups, and that's fine! But I do want to bring one of my favorite oWoD groups back to nWoD, and think they fit very well as a Conspiracy. Their Endowment is clear - Projection, the ability to temporarily become a ghost - but how would we do this mechanically?<br /> <br /> I want to know how a mortal characters attributes convert into the simplified Power/Finesse/Resolve for ghosts, and how we would determine which Numina/Dread Powers to allow. Anyone willing to help?<br /> <br /> My rough idea for Projection, at least, is a probably a Resolve or Composure + Occult or Medicine roll, and the spending of a Willpower point, to become a ghost for a scene (spend a Willpower point to remain a ghost each scene afterwards, no roll needed).","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Remi. she/her. game designer.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/281-atamajakki","name":"atamajakki","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar281_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5487"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-07T21:03:50-08:00","id":25576,"title":"","content":"Hmm. Ways to do it and make it powerful. What if it's half your total attribute points in that category, rounded up? So if I've got Intelligence 2, Strength 3 and Presence 4, I get a Power of 5. That seems like it'd be able to make the Projections pretty powerful. I'm envisioning that Essence access/Numina might be controlled by the amount of points one has in Projection.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I am no longer participating in the community. Please do not contact me about my previous work.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/159-leetsepeak","name":"Leetsepeak","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4259"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-07T22:55:30-08:00","id":25616,"title":"","content":"You could adapt the traits based off of the above post and have Willpower be the pool to show that while powerful, you run the penalty of being weak due to being alive.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/213-darkhunter","name":"Darkhunter","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar213_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"65"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-08T00:15:51-08:00","id":25649,"title":"","content":"Glamourweaver might one day publish KSI-29. A Russian KGB like group who blend occult research and looted Nazi technology to let agents in cryogenic suspension project. I'm looking forward to them. I think KGB ruthlessness works well with the Underworld's general oppression.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>\u201cThere are no rules. Only Principles and natural laws.\u201d - Promethius<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/17686-the-kings-raven-s-homebrwe-index\" target=