 /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/17686-the-kings-raven-s-homebrwe-index\" target=\"_blank\">My Homebrew no longer fits in a signature, you can find an index of it here</a>.<br /> <b>Full length fan-books I contributed too: </b><a href=\"https://sites.google.com/site/princessthehopeful/files/PrincessTheHopeful.pdf?attredirects=0&amp;d=1\" target=\"_blank\">Princess: the Hopeful</a>, <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/0B9DMG5y7ZdngekVaMGNQbTF4RzA\" target=\"_blank\">Leviathan: the Tempest</a>, <a href=\"https://sites.google.com/site/thekingsraven/files/DreamCatchers.pdf?attredirects=0&amp;d=1\" target=\"_blank\">Dream Catchers</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/134-the-kings-raven","name":"The Kings Raven","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar134_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3003"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-08T20:14:54-08:00","id":26245,"title":"","content":"I have thought on the same topic as you, atamajakki. I feel that Orpheus would make a great Conspiracy.<br /> <br /> When I was looking into this, I cribbed notes off of projecting found in Second Sight. I would make characters buy the meditative mind merit and then have them roll that to project. As far as stats went, at first I went for the average of each stat based on power, finesse or resistance. However when I looked at the rules in Mummy for Ghosts that are conscious, they had it to where they get their full compliment of stats back.<br /> <br /> As far as powers, I would just let characters purchase numina that they could only use while they were projecting. They would fuel these with willpower. Since willpower would be their fuel, I took the idea that Skimmers would take a bashing level of damage for every scene that they remained out of body (OOB) past the first one.<br /> <br /> I hope this helps!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>If people were meant to run around naked, they would be born that way.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1286-nikuchan","name":"Nikuchan","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1286_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-10T22:37:01-08:00","id":27781,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>The Kings Raven</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/hunter-the-vigil/25569-how-would-you-do-the-orpheus-group?p=25718#post25718\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">There's stuff on the <a href=\"http://forums.whitewolfarchive.com/\" target=\"_blank\">old forums</a> but there's no way to search, so you need to hope Glamourweaver drops by this thread.</div> </div> </div> </div><a href=\"http://forums.whitewolfarchive.com/default8338.html?g=posts&amp;t=9248\" target=\"_blank\">Stuff like this.</a>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div style=\"margin-left:40px\"> <div align=\"center\">My hacks: <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwtrin\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#0000FF\">Trinity Continuum</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwscion\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#008000\">Scion</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwExalt\" target=\"_blank\